#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:141
msgid ""
"Customers will have 9 months to plan, test, and upgrade their PostgreSQL "
"version before the new requirement takes effect. This policy aims to "
"provide clarity and transparency so you can align database upgrades with "
"the Mattermost release schedule. Contact a `Mattermost Expert "
"<https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_. to discuss your options."
msgstr ""
"고객은 새 요건이 적용되기 전에 PostgreSQL 버전을 계획·테스트·업그레이드할 9개월의 "
"시간을 갖게 됩니다. 이 정책은 데이터베이스 업그레이드를 OKR.BEST 릴리스 "
"일정에 맞출 수 있도록 명확성과 투명성을 제공하는 것을 목표로 합니다. 옵션을 "
"논의하려면 `Mattermost 전문가 <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_\\ 에게 "
"문의하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:144
msgid "Database Search limitations"
msgstr "데이터베이스 검색 제한"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:146
msgid "Common limitations:"
msgstr "공통 제한:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:148
msgid ""
"Only the initial **1 MB** of the file content is available for search, "
"even though much bigger files can be uploaded."
msgstr ""
"훨씬 큰 파일을 업로드할 수 있더라도, 파일 내용의 처음 **1 MB**\\ 만 검색에 "
"사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:150
msgid "Search limitations on PostgreSQL:"
msgstr "PostgreSQL의 검색 제한:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:152
msgid "Email addresses do not return results."
msgstr "이메일 주소는 검색 결과를 반환하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:153
msgid ""
"Hashtags or recent mentions of usernames containing a dash do not return "
"search results."
msgstr ""
"대시(-)가 포함된 해시태그나 최근 사용자 ID 멘션은 검색 결과를 반환하지 "
"않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:154
msgid ""
"Terms containing a dash return incorrect results as dashes are ignored in"
" the search query."
msgstr ""
"대시가 포함된 용어는 검색 쿼리에서 대시가 무시되므로 잘못된 결과를 "
"반환합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:155
msgid ""
"Limitations set by `PostgreSQL itself "
"<https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/textsearch-limitations.html>`_:"
msgstr ""
"`PostgreSQL 자체 "
"<https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/textsearch-limitations.html>`_\\ "
"가 설정한 제한:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:157
msgid ""
"One of them is: ``The length of a tsvector (lexemes + positions) must be "
"less than 1 megabyte``, which means that, based on the file content, even"
" files with content less than 1 MB won't be searchable if they hit the "
"``tsvector`` limit of 1 MB."
msgstr ""
"그중 하나는 ``The length of a tsvector (lexemes + positions) must be less "
"than 1 megabyte``\\ 로, 파일 내용에 따라 내용이 1 MB 미만인 파일이라도 "
"``tsvector`` 1 MB 제한에 도달하면 검색되지 않음을 의미합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:159
msgid ""
"If any of the above is an issue, you can :doc:`set up and enable "
"enterprise search </administration-guide/scale/enterprise-search>`."
msgstr ""
"위 사항 중 하나라도 문제가 된다면 :doc:`엔터프라이즈 검색을 설정하고 활성화 "
"</administration-guide/scale/enterprise-search>`\\ 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:162
msgid "MySQL Support"
msgstr "MySQL 지원"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:163
msgid ""
":doc:`MySQL database support </deployment-guide/server/prepare-"
"mattermost-mysql-database>` is being deprecated starting with Mattermost "
"v11. See the :doc:`PostgreSQL migration </deployment-guide/postgres-"
"migration>` documentation for guidance on migrating from MySQL to "
"PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
":doc:`MySQL 데이터베이스 지원 </deployment-guide/server/prepare-mattermost-"
"mysql-database>`\\ 은 OKR.BEST v11부터 지원 중단됩니다. MySQL에서 PostgreSQL로 "
"마이그레이션하는 안내는 :doc:`PostgreSQL 마이그레이션 </deployment-guide"
"/postgres-migration>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:165
msgid ""
"Search limitations on MySQL: Hashtags or recent mentions of usernames "
"containing a dot do not return search results."
msgstr ""
"MySQL의 검색 제한: 점(.)이 포함된 해시태그나 최근 사용자 ID 멘션은 검색 "
"결과를 반환하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:166
msgid ""
"The migration system requires the MySQL database user to have additional "
"`EXECUTE`, `CREATE ROUTINE`, `ALTER ROUTINE` and `REFERENCES` privileges "
"to run schema migrations."
msgstr ""
"마이그레이션 시스템은 스키마 마이그레이션을 실행하기 위해 MySQL 데이터베이스 "
"사용자가 `EXECUTE`, `CREATE ROUTINE`, `ALTER ROUTINE`, `REFERENCES` 권한을 "
"추가로 가지고 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:168
msgid ""
"Deployments requiring searching in Chinese, Japanese, and Korean "
"languages require MySQL 5.7.6+ and the configuration of `ngram Full-Text "
"parser <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.7/en/fulltext-search-"
"ngram.html>`__. For searching two characters, you will also need to set "
"``ft_min_word_len`` and ``innodb_ft_min_token_size`` to ``2`` and restart"
" MySQL. See `CJK discussion "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/issues/2033#issuecomment-183872616>`__"
" for details."
msgstr ""
"중국어, 일본어, 한국어 검색이 필요한 배포에는 MySQL 5.7.6 이상과 `ngram 전문 "
"검색 파서 <https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.7/en/fulltext-search-"
"ngram.html>`__ 구성이 필요합니다. 두 글자를 검색하려면 ``ft_min_word_len``\\ "
"과 ``innodb_ft_min_token_size``\\ 를 ``2``\\ 로 설정하고 MySQL을 다시 "
"시작해야 합니다. 자세한 내용은 `CJK 논의 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/issues/2033#issuecomment-183872616>`__"
"\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:172
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:191
msgid ""
"MySQL 8.0.22 contains an `issue with JSON column types "
"<https://bugs.mysql.com/bug.php?id=101284>`__ changing string values to "
"integers which is preventing Mattermost from working properly. Users are "
"advised to avoid this database version."
msgstr ""
"MySQL 8.0.22에는 문자열 값을 정수로 바꾸는 `JSON 열 유형 관련 이슈 "
"<https://bugs.mysql.com/bug.php?id=101284>`__\\ 가 있어 OKR.BEST가 제대로 "
"작동하지 못합니다. 이 데이터베이스 버전을 피할 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:174
msgid ""
"In MySQL 8.0.4, the default authentication plugin was changed from "
"``mysql_native_password`` to ``caching_sha2_password``. Therefore, you "
"will need to enable ``mysql_native_password`` by adding the following "
"entry in your MySQL configuration file:"
msgstr ""
"MySQL 8.0.4에서 기본 인증 플러그인이 ``mysql_native_password``\\ 에서 "
"``caching_sha2_password``\\ 로 변경되었습니다. 따라서 MySQL 구성 파일에 다음 "
"항목을 추가하여 ``mysql_native_password``\\ 를 활성화해야 합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:181
msgid ""
"In MySQL 8, the default collation changed to ``utf8mb4_0900_ai_ci`` "
"(https://dev.mysql.com/doc/mysqld-version-reference/en/optvar-"
"changes-8-0.html). Therefore, if you update your MySQL installation to "
"version 8, you'll need to convert your database tables to use the new "
"default collation:"
msgstr ""
"MySQL 8에서 기본 데이터 정렬(collation)이 ``utf8mb4_0900_ai_ci``\\ 로 "
"변경되었습니다(https://dev.mysql.com/doc/mysqld-version-reference/en/optvar-"
"changes-8-0.html). 따라서 MySQL 설치를 버전 8로 업데이트하는 경우, 새 기본 "
"데이터 정렬을 사용하도록 데이터베이스 테이블을 변환해야 합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:187
msgid ""
"If this change isn't made, tables in the database may end up having "
"different collations which will cause errors when executing queries."
msgstr ""
"이 변경을 하지 않으면 데이터베이스의 테이블들이 서로 다른 데이터 정렬을 갖게 "
"되어 쿼리 실행 시 오류가 발생할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:189
msgid ""
"In MySQL versions 8.0.0 - 8.0.11 ``ADMIN`` is a `reserved keyword "
"<https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/keywords.html>`_, which is why "
"our requirement for MySQL is version 8.0.12."
msgstr ""
"MySQL 8.0.0 - 8.0.11 버전에서 ``ADMIN``\\ 은 `예약어 "
"<https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/keywords.html>`_\\ 이며, 이것이 "
"MySQL 요건이 8.0.12 버전인 이유입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:194
msgid "Hardware requirements"
msgstr "하드웨어 요구 사항"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:196
msgid ""
"Usage of CPU, RAM, and storage space can vary significantly based on user"
" behavior. These hardware recommendations are based on traditional "
"deployments and may grow or shrink depending on how active your users "
"are."
msgstr ""
"CPU, RAM, 저장 공간 사용량은 사용자 행동에 따라 크게 달라질 수 있습니다. 이 "
"하드웨어 권장 사항은 일반적인 배포를 기준으로 하며, 사용자가 얼마나 "
"활발하게 활동하느냐에 따라 늘거나 줄 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:198
msgid ""
"Moreover, memory requirements can be driven by peak file sharing "
"activity. Recommendation is based on default 50 MB maximum file size, "
"which can be :ref:`adjusted from the System Console <administration-"
"guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:maximum file size>`. "
"Changing this number may change memory requirements."
msgstr ""
"또한 메모리 요구 사항은 최대 파일 공유 활동에 따라 결정될 수 있습니다. 권장 "
"사항은 기본 최대 파일 크기 50 MB를 기준으로 하며, 이는 :ref:`관리자 도구에서 "
"조정 <administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-"
"settings:maximum file size>`\\ 할 수 있습니다. 이 값을 변경하면 메모리 요구 "
"사항이 달라질 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:200
msgid ""
"For deployments larger than 2,000 users, it is recommended to use the "
"Mattermost open source load testing framework to simulate usage of your "
"system at full scale: `https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-load-"
"test-ng <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-load-test-ng>`__."
msgstr ""
"2,000명을 초과하는 배포에서는 Mattermost 오픈소스 부하 테스트 프레임워크를 "
"사용해 시스템을 전체 규모로 시뮬레이션할 것을 권장합니다: "
"`https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-load-test-ng "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-load-test-ng>`__."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:202
msgid "Mattermost supports any 64-bit x86 processor architecture."
msgstr "OKR.BEST는 모든 64비트 x86 프로세서 아키텍처를 지원합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:205
msgid "Hardware requirements for team deployments"
msgstr "팀 배포의 하드웨어 요구 사항"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:207
msgid ""
"Most small to medium Mattermost team deployments can be supported on a "
"single server with the following specifications based on registered "
"users:"
msgstr ""
"대부분의 중소 규모 OKR.BEST 팀 배포는 등록 사용자 수에 따라 다음 사양의 단일 "
"서버로 지원할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:209
msgid "1 - 1,000 users - 1 vCPU/cores, 2 GB RAM"
msgstr "1~1,000명 - vCPU/코어 1개, RAM 2 GB"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:210
msgid "1,000 - 2,000 users - 2 vCPUs/cores, 4 GB RAM"
msgstr "1,000~2,000명 - vCPU/코어 2개, RAM 4 GB"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:215
msgid "Hardware requirements for enterprise deployments (multi-server)"
msgstr "엔터프라이즈 배포(다중 서버)의 하드웨어 요구 사항"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:218
msgid "Scale requirements"
msgstr "확장 요구 사항"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:220
msgid ""
"For Enterprise Edition deployments with a multi-server setup, see "
":doc:`our scaling guide </administration-guide/scale/scaling-for-"
"enterprise>`."
msgstr ""
"다중 서버 구성의 Enterprise Edition 배포는 :doc:`확장 가이드 </administration-"
"guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise>`\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:222
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended that pilots are run before enterprise-wide "
"deployments in order to estimate full scale usage based on your specific "
"organizational needs. You can use the Mattermost open source load testing"
" framework to simulate usage of your system: "
"`https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-load-test-ng "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-load-test-ng>`__."
msgstr ""
"전사 배포 전에 조직의 특정 요구를 기준으로 전체 규모 사용량을 추정하기 위해 "
"파일럿을 실행할 것을 강력히 권장합니다. Mattermost 오픈소스 부하 테스트 "
"프레임워크를 사용해 시스템 사용량을 시뮬레이션할 수 있습니다: "
"`https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-load-test-ng "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-load-test-ng>`__."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:224
msgid ""
"Mattermost's :doc:`performance monitoring </administration-guide/scale"
"/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>` tools can be used"
" for detailed performance measurements and to inspect the running system "
"to ensure sizing and installation is correct."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST의 :doc:`성능 모니터링 </administration-guide/scale/deploy-"
"prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>` 도구를 사용해 상세한 성능을 "
"측정하고 실행 중인 시스템을 점검하여 사이징과 설치가 올바른지 확인할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:227
msgid "System requirements"
msgstr "시스템 요구 사항"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:229
msgid ""
"For Enterprise Edition deployments with a multi-server setup, we highly "
"recommend the following systems to support your Mattermost deployment:"
msgstr ""
"다중 서버 구성의 Enterprise Edition 배포에서는 OKR.BEST 배포를 지원하기 위해 "
"다음 시스템을 강력히 권장합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:231
msgid ""
"Prometheus to track system health of your Mattermost deployment, through "
":doc:`performance monitoring feature </administration-guide/scale/deploy-"
"prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>` available in Mattermost "
"Enterprise."
msgstr ""
"Mattermost Enterprise에서 제공되는 :doc:`성능 모니터링 기능 </administration-"
"guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>`\\ 을 통해 "
"OKR.BEST 배포의 시스템 상태를 추적하는 Prometheus."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:232
msgid ""
"Grafana to visualize the system health metrics collected by Prometheus "
"with the :doc:`performance monitoring feature </administration-"
"guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring>`. "
"Grafana 5.0.0 and later is recommended."
msgstr ""
":doc:`성능 모니터링 기능 </administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-"
"grafana-for-performance-monitoring>`\\ 으로 Prometheus가 수집한 시스템 상태 "
"지표를 시각화하는 Grafana. Grafana 5.0.0 이상을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:233
msgid ""
"Elasticsearch to support highly efficient database searches in a cluster "
"environment. Elasticsearch v8.x and v9.x are supported, and Elasticsearch"
" v9.x or AWS OpenSearch is recommended. :doc:`Learn more "
"</administration-guide/scale/enterprise-search>`."
msgstr ""
"클러스터 환경에서 매우 효율적인 데이터베이스 검색을 지원하는 Elasticsearch. "
"Elasticsearch v8.x와 v9.x가 지원되며 Elasticsearch v9.x 또는 AWS OpenSearch를 "
"권장합니다. :doc:`자세히 알아보기 </administration-guide/scale/enterprise-"
"search>`."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/software-hardware-requirements.rst:234
msgid ""
"AWS S3 or any S3-compatible service. Mattermost is compatible with object"
" storage systems which implement the S3 API. You can also use local "
"storage or a network drive using NFS. Learn more about file storage "
"configuration options :ref:`in our documentation <administration-"
"guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:file storage>`."
msgstr ""
"AWS S3 또는 S3 호환 서비스. OKR.BEST는 S3 API를 구현하는 오브젝트 스토리지 "
"시스템과 호환됩니다. 로컬 저장소나 NFS를 사용하는 네트워크 드라이브도 사용할 "
"수 있습니다. 파일 저장소 구성 옵션에 대한 자세한 내용은 :ref:`문서 "
"<administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:file "
"storage>`\\ 를 참고하세요."

